.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
tfplan.json
backend.hcl
*.tfvars.json

# Two inputs cannot be committed, and both are REQUIRED variables so their absence fails loudly:
#   emails.auto.tfvars  budget_alert_emails — personal addresses, and this repo is public.
#   box.auto.tfvars     console_writer_source_cidrs — the production box's origin addresses, which
#                       sit behind the Cloudflare tunnel and are not published anywhere else.
emails.auto.tfvars
box.auto.tfvars

# terraform.tfvars is committed HERE on purpose, overriding `**/terraform.tfvars` in
# infra/.gitignore and `infra/**/terraform.tfvars` in the root one. Only already-public values.
!terraform.tfvars
